al. Team up with fellow <strong>Brinehunters</strong> and carefully choose synergic loadouts, skills, suits, and weapon mods. Work together and fight through a merciless roguelite gauntlet, where no run is the same as the last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1748449521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/Abyssus_Titres_EN_2.gif?t=1748449521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wield highly customizable, brine-powered armaments and infuse them with the might of ancient Gods. Master 8 weapons and 45 weapon mods, upgrading your skills and suit as you face the underwater kingdom\u2019s mutated guardians. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/Aby_Workbenchv2.gif?t=1748449521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/Abyssus_Titres_EN_3.gif?t=1748449521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run after run, you\u2019ll access more and more upgrades and tactical choices, but firepower alone won\u2019t save you from the denizens of the depths. Mastering <i>Abyssus</i>'s visceral gunplay and fast-paced action will require tactical coordination, positioning skills, and cohesive teamwork. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/Aby_blessingV2.gif?t=1748449521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721110/extras/Abyssus_Titres_EN_4.gif?t=1748449521\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The 